# Build context for sonar/Dockerfile.sonar only. BuildKit (the default builder since
# Docker 23) reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile instead of the root
# .dockerignore, which ADBox images share: they need adbox/assets/secrets, SONAR must not.
#
# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include what the image needs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!README.md
!sonar
# pyproject.toml declares the adbox package, so the root install needs it to exist;
# the SONAR image needs none of ADBox's code, models or secrets.
!adbox/__init__.py

# Never ship secrets, local models or debug output, even from re-included directories.
**/.env
**/*.pkl
sonar/payloads
# A delivery watermark baked into the image would suppress anomalies in production.
sonar/models/state
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
